"The [Mirai] lines of the internal notes could not be updated. The details "
"are in the server log."
msgstr ""
"No se han podido actualizar las líneas [Mirai] de las notas internas. Los "
"detalles están en el registro del servidor."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel changed the extra %(extra)s from %(old)s to %(new)s, but it is "
"managed by hand in this folio: review it."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha cambiado el extra %(extra)s de %(old)s a %(new)s, pero en esta "
"ficha se gestiona a mano: revíselo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel changed the extra %(extra)s from %(old)s to %(new)s, but its "
"service could not be updated: %(error)s"
msgstr ""
"El canal ha cambiado el extra %(extra)s de %(old)s a %(new)s, pero no se ha "
"podido actualizar su servicio: %(error)s"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel changed the extra %(extra)s from %(old)s to %(new)s, but its "
"service was changed by hand or invoiced, so it was not updated: review it."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha cambiado el extra %(extra)s de %(old)s a %(new)s, pero su "
"servicio se cambió a mano o está facturado, así que no se ha actualizado: "
"revíselo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel extras are in %(currency)s and the folio in %(folio_currency)s, "
"so they were not imported: %(extras)s."
msgstr ""
"Los extras del canal están en %(currency)s y la ficha en %(folio_currency)s,"
" así que no se han importado: %(extras)s."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel moved the stay of the extra %(extra)s, but its service is "
"invoiced, so it stays on the cancelled room: review it."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha movido la estancia del extra %(extra)s, pero su servicio está "
"facturado, así que se queda en la habitación cancelada: revíselo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel moved the stay of the extra %(extra)s: its service is created "
"again as the channel sends it, without the changes made by hand (%(old)s)."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha movido la estancia del extra %(extra)s: su servicio se crea de "
"nuevo tal y como lo envía el canal, sin los cambios hechos a mano (%(old)s)."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel removed the extra %(extra)s, but its service was changed by hand"
" or invoiced, so it was kept: review it."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha quitado el extra %(extra)s, pero su servicio se cambió a mano o "
"está facturado, así que se ha mantenido: revíselo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel split this booking into %(count)s folios and each one repeats "
"the extras of the whole booking, so they were not imported: %(extras)s. Add "
"them by hand to the folio they belong to."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha dividido esta reserva en %(count)s fichas y cada una repite los "
"extras de toda la reserva, así que no se han importado: %(extras)s. Añádalos"
" a mano a la ficha que corresponda."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:connector_pms_wubook.constraint_channel_wubook_backend_extra_backend_normalized_name_uniq
msgid "This extra is already mapped in this backend."
msgstr "Este extra ya está mapeado en este backend."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Upselling applied: %(amount)s (according to Mirai, the guest pays it at the "
"hotel)"
msgstr ""
"Upselling aplicado: %(amount)s (según Mirai, lo paga el huésped en el hotel)"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_extras_state
msgid "What the import did with each channel extra of the folio."
msgstr "Lo que hizo la importación con cada extra del canal de la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_backend_type_ota__import_channel_notes
msgid ""
"Write in the folio internal notes what the channel passes through for "
"reception. Only Mirai passes any for now: the loyalty club membership and "
"the upselling the guest pays at the hotel."
msgstr ""
"Escribir en las notas internas de la ficha lo que el canal transmite para "
"recepción. De momento solo Mirai envía algo: la pertenencia al club de "
"fidelización y el upselling que el huésped paga en el hotel."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "its price is negative"
msgstr "su precio es negativo"

